        "question": "How does it differ from the yellow-lemon treefrog?",
        "answer": "Both are treefrogs. Colour is not reliable. Range is more useful: this species occupies most of Georgia; the yellow-lemon treefrog is the dry country south-east of Tbilisi. In the contact zone they can look alike."
