      {
        "question": "Does it make a sound?",
        "answer": "Yes. A sharp metallic chit-chit-chit. The clip on this page is from Turkey (xeno-canto XC961887) and is marked uncertain by the recordist; there is no Georgian recording here."
      },
      {
        "question": "Is it dangerous?",
        "answer": "It is not venomous. It can bite if handled. Do not pick it up."
      },
      {
        "question": "Is it protected?",
        "answer": "Globally Least Concern. On Georgia’s 2014 Red List it is Vulnerable because of an introduced squirrel. Do not treat IUCN LC as a licence to take it."
      }
